  question: "Which operator should replace '-' to initialize 'x' to 5 in this declaration?"
  answerA: "Use '==' to initialize x to 5."
  answerB: "Use '=' to initialize x to 5."
  answerC: "Use '!=' to initialize x to 5."
  answerD: "Use '<=' to initialize x to 5."
  correctAnswer: 1
